				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Enrich crate-level doc comments with cross-references and links\n\nConvert the crate-level description in Library.rs to a proper markdown heading augmented with an emoji and a link to editor.land. Add a cross-reference to the Architecture.md documentation to help developers navigate the broader Land system doc tree. Upgrade the bare `// Library version` comment on the VERSION constant to a fully documented doc comment with the source-of-truth annotation.\n\nTidying the entry-point documentation improves discoverability and sets a consistent doc-standards baseline for new contributors.",
			"SHA": "c6d97890fe7db7a32b701e06a9b652001d36d0ee"
		},
