				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				80,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Restructure README with compact overview and simplified layout\n\nReduce the README from 124 to 28 lines by removing the decorative HTML table header, consolidating the introductory text into a single concise overview paragraph, and integrating the Key Features, Security, and Compatibility sections into inline prose rather than standalone bullet/table blocks. Drop the redundant \"Grove in the Land Ecosystem\" role table, the \"Deep Dive & Component Breakdown\" source-link section, the Changelog reference, the License section, and the verbose Project Maintainers footer. Move the Project Structure tree higher for quicker orientation. Replace the funding/logos HTML table with a compact Markdown image grid. Fix three badge links from /tree/Current/ to /blob/Current/ for LICENSE and version badges.\n\nThis preserves all technical content while improving scanability and reducing visual noise for a README that serves as a quick introduction rather than full documentation.",
			"SHA": "0b017fded7546c0aeca13bbfdd799d42ca0c5e8d"
